{"total_count":6,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod/issues/5278","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod/issues/5278/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod/issues/5278/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod/issues/5278/events","html_url":"https://github.com/colinhacks/zod/pull/5278","id":3447716786,"node_id":"PR_kwDODqUnoM6qMw7W","number":5278,"title":"refac(errors): Unify code structure and improve types","user":{"login":"ssi02014","id":64779472,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0Nzc5NDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64779472?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssi02014","html_url":"https://github.com/ssi02014","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssi02014/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssi02014/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssi02014/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssi02014/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssi02014/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssi02014/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssi02014/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssi02014/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssi02014/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-09-24T05:27:22Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T01:57:53Z","closed_at":"2025-10-01T17:25:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod/pulls/5278","html_url":"https://github.com/colinhacks/zod/pull/5278","diff_url":"https://github.com/colinhacks/zod/pull/5278.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/colinhacks/zod/pull/5278.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-01T17:25:55Z"},"body":"## Work Overview \r\nUnifying the default value assignment logic for the mapper within the errors file and improving the any type.\r\n\r\n### as-is\r\n```ts\r\nexport function flattenError(error: $ZodError, mapper = (issue: $ZodIssue) => issue.message) {}\r\n\r\nexport function treeifyError<T>(error: $ZodError, _mapper?: any) {\r\n  const mapper: (issue: $ZodIssue) => any =\r\n    _mapper ||\r\n    function (issue: $ZodIssue) {\r\n      return issue.message;\r\n    };\r\n  // ...\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport function formatError<T>(error: $ZodError, _mapper?: any) {\r\n  const mapper: (issue: $ZodIssue) => any =\r\n    _mapper ||\r\n    function (issue: $ZodIssue) {\r\n      return issue.message;\r\n    };\r\n  // ...\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### to-be\r\n```ts\r\nexport function flattenError<T, U>(error: $ZodError<T>, mapper = (issue: $ZodIssue) => issue.message as U) {}\r\nexport function treeifyError<T, U>(error: $ZodError<T>, mapper = (issue: $ZodIssue) => issue.message as U) {}\r\nexport function formatError<T, U>(error: $ZodError<T>, mapper = (issue: $ZodIssue) => issue.message as U) {}\r\n```","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod/issues/5278/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod/issues/5278/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod/issues/1617","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod/issues/1617/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod/issues/1617/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/colinhacks/zod/issues/1617/events","html_url":"https://github.com/colinhacks/zod/pull/16